WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Standing light kick begins the recorded light link at the corner.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.600
OD Freeflow Strikes follows the three-light link.

3
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:02.950
The first OD punch follow-up continues before the second punch and Super.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.650
The second punch follow-up links to Super.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.400
Jamie activates Level 2.

6
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.100
Standing heavy punch catches Ryu after activation.

7
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:06.800
Medium Arrow begins the corner juggle.

8
